# Material UI (admin + web)

When building or changing UI in `apps/admin` or `apps/web`, always read and follow
`.agents/skills/mui/SKILL.md` (and `.agents/skills/mui/resources/` as needed).

Patterns:

- Prefer stock `@mui/material` components (Button, TextField, Stack, Card, etc.)
- Style with typed `sx` / theme tokens (`color: 'text.secondary'`, `p: 2`), not ad-hoc CSS
- Use `slotProps` on MUI v7+
- Wire Next App Router with `@mui/material-nextjs/v16-appRouter` + `ThemeProvider` + `CssBaseline`
- Do not reintroduce Gluestack, UniWind, React Native Paper, or react-native-web into admin/web
- Component placement (see CLAUDE.md): shared → `src/components/`; route-only →
  `app/.../<route>/components/`. Reuse existing components instead of duplicating.

Mobile UI rules live in `.cursor/rules/expo-mobile-ui.mdc` and `CLAUDE.md`.
